[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4657700801","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120103#issuecomment-4657700801","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120103","id":4657700801,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFZ7fwQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T08:15:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T08:15:32Z","body":"Starting a new line after the `push_indent` is intentional, it should not be used in the middle of the line.\n\nEach subsequent call starts a new line with a nested indent as expected:\n<img width=\"196\" height=\"89\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/53f9819e-5276-4908-b938-c8ecb4eb6e8d\" />\n\nThe wrong `push_indent(4)` size likely is a bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4657700801/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658438380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120103#issuecomment-4658438380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120103","id":4658438380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFaog7A","user":{"login":"MikeSchulze","id":347037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NzAzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/347037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeSchulze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T09:36:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T09:40:20Z","body":"> Starting a new line after the `push_indent` is intentional, it should not be used in the middle of the line.\n> \n> Each subsequent call starts a new line with a nested indent as expected: <img alt=\"Image\" width=\"196\" height=\"89\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/7645683/604951302-53f9819e-5276-4908-b938-c8ecb4eb6e8d.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..P-DmZmE51PF6yp2pm6KoExLiL_MEeWeRjv8KyqdLtyI\">\n> \n> The wrong `push_indent(4)` size likely is a bug.\n\nThere is no documentation about new line when using `push_indent` and it worked years without, why is this now intentional?\nIt makes no sense to add a new line, e.g. i want to write a single line with an intend of 4 chars I have to write\n\n```\nrtf.push_indent(1)\nrtf.append_text(\"foo\")\nrtf.pop()\n```\nShould result in:\n`    foo`\nand not in\n```\n\n foo\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658438380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658509491","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120103#issuecomment-4658509491","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120103","id":4658509491,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFas2sw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T09:44:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T09:44:49Z","body":"> Should result in: \n\nAnd this is how it is working, it's not adding new lines, but it is always the first thing in the line. If the line is empty, no new line is added. But multiple indents on the same line make no sense.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658509491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658571089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120103#issuecomment-4658571089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120103","id":4658571089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFawnUQ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T09:53:00Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T09:53:00Z","body":"It was always setting flag to ensure new line, so it likely was a bug with some empty lines not shown which was fixed. But I guess supporting subsequent `push_indent` on the same line (if there's no other stuff in between) won't break anything.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658571089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658624486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120103#issuecomment-4658624486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120103","id":4658624486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFaz35g","user":{"login":"MikeSchulze","id":347037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NzAzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/347037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeSchulze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeSchulze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T10:00:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T10:00:28Z","body":"Nope, its a Bug\n```\n\t_output.push_indent(1)\n\t_output.append_text(\"message\")\n\t_output.push_indent(1)\n\t_output.append_text(\"with\")\n\t_output.push_indent(1)\n\t_output.append_text(\"indent\")\n\t_output.pop()\n\t_output.pop()\n\t_output.pop()\n```\nResults in extra new lines.\n\n<img width=\"473\" height=\"172\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2b4eaf6-3f43-4ff1-a5bc-707f91088d6a\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng